    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aShiyuh of Love\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shiyuh of love is a text-based visual novel game. In the story, players take on the role of the protagonist, Kevin, spending a summer with Shiyuh, a mysterious girl who suddenly appears in his home. Together, they gradually uncover the secrets of their intertwined pasts, leading toward the story's conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360070/extras/84522a77618ee2c410d13c15e8d582e3.avif?t=1742379384\" width=694 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aGame Features\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Spend unique moments with Shiyuh based on your choices!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Approximately 70,000 words of storyline.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two different endings and several beautifully crafted CG illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aAbout This Game\u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone, I\u2019m Zera, the person in charge of <i>The Love of Tianhe</i>, and also a member of a project team at Taichung University of Science and Technology. I\u2019d like to share with you the story behind the creation of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When we were preparing to submit our project proposal, we had already set a clear goal: <strong>\u201cWe want to create a bishoujo visual novel and publish it on Steam.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, we boldly wrote the title <i>The Love of Tianhe</i> on the proposal, and that marked the beginning of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although I might be letting you down a bit by saying this, we know there\u2019s still room for improvement in various aspects of the game\u2014be it the illustrations, the system, or missing features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s why I hope this game serves as our starting point, and I also hope that all of you can continue to support us in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there are people out there who wish to chase dreams with us, we\u2019d love to collaborate with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aShiyuh of Love\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shiyuh of love is a text-based visual novel game. In the story, players take on the role of the protagonist, Kevin, spending a summer with Shiyuh, a mysterious girl who suddenly appears in his home. Together, they gradually uncover the secrets of their intertwined pasts, leading toward the story's conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360070/extras/84522a77618ee2c410d13c15e8d582e3.avif?t=1742379384\" width=694 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aGame Features\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Spend unique moments with Shiyuh based on your choices!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Approximately 70,000 words of storyline.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two different endings and several beautifully crafted CG illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aAbout This Game\u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone, I\u2019m Zera, the person in charge of <i>The Love of Tianhe</i>, and also a member of a project team at Taichung University of Science and Technology. I\u2019d like to share with you the story behind the creation of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When we were preparing to submit our project proposal, we had already set a clear goal: <strong>\u201cWe want to create a bishoujo visual novel and publish it on Steam.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, we boldly wrote the title <i>The Love of Tianhe</i> on the proposal, and that marked the beginning of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although I might be letting you down a bit by saying this, we know there\u2019s still room for improvement in various aspects of the game\u2014be it the illustrations, the system, or missing features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s why I hope this game serves as our starting point, and I also hope that all of you can continue to support us in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there are people out there who wish to chase dreams with us, we\u2019d love to collaborate with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
